  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.63 Person",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.63 “Person” means “person” as defined by RSA 125-C:2, X, namely “any individual, partnership, firm or co-partnership, association, company, trust, corporation, department, bureau, agency, private or municipal corporation, or any political subdivision of the state, the United States or political subdivisions or agencies thereof, or any other entity recognized by law as subject to rights and duties.”\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09 (from Env-A 4602.64); ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.59); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.64)",
